==Battleground==
*1 [[Mr. Puffington]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Codename "Red Riding"]] spawns as the boss after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*5 [[Tackey]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*3 [[Red EnerG]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 46.67~50 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The Mr. Puffington is actually the least threatening enemy here, as it can be killed quickly by [[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi]]. Instead, the main menaces in the stage are the Red EnerGs and possibly Tackeys, as Tackey's LD attacks can hit most Anti-Surge units meant to counter Red EnerG, turning this into an endurance battle.

So you can cheese this instead by sending Idi to quickly kill Puffington, before then using that money to summon [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] with [[Curling Cat (Rare Cat)|Green Shell Cat]] so that the latter tanks the Red EnerGs while Bahamut kills Mina. You're gonna have to boost Green Shell around 45-50. You also need [[Ototo Corps#Breakerblast|Breakerblast]] and a starting Cat Cannon [[Cat Combo]] to push back Red EnerG in order to prevent his Surge Attacks from sniping your cats.

